 "notes": [
  {
   "html": "<p>With shiitake–kombu dashi it’s fully vegetarian (the eggs are the only animal product).</p>",
   "title_html": "Vegetarian"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Your notes didn’t include quantities — these mirror the oyakodon proportions, with <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"150\" data-s=\"0\">150 g</span> napa standing in for the <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"150\" data-s=\"0\">150 g</span> chicken.</p>",
   "title_html": "Amounts"
  },
  {
   "html": "<p>Water + <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.25\" data-s=\"0\">¼ tsp</span> dashi powder, or the soaking water from the shiitake on its own.</p>",
   "title_html": "No homemade dashi?"
  }
 ],
